---
layout: layouts/base.njk
isHome: true
title: 中文网络工具与数字生活指南
description: 面向中文用户的网络工具内容站，提供服务评测、客户端教程、工具下载、横向对比与数字生活指南。
permalink: /index.html
---
{% from "macros/icon.njk" import icon %}
{% from "macros/cards.njk" import articleCard, faq %}
<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-line bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,#f7f9ff_0%,#fff_75%)]">
  <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-[38rem] w-[70rem] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle,rgba(67,97,238,.12),transparent_62%)]"></div>
  <div class="container-shell relative grid min-h-[660px] items-center gap-12 py-20 lg:grid-cols-[1.08fr_.92fr] lg:py-24">
    <div class="animate-reveal max-w-2xl">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-brand-100 bg-white/80 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-600 shadow-sm backdrop-blur"><span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 shadow-[0_0_0_4px_rgba(67,216,208,.12)]"></span>结构化中文内容站 · 持续更新</div>
      <h1 class="mt-7 text-[clamp(2.7rem,6vw,5.2rem)] font-black leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.06em] text-ink-950">更清晰地理解<br><span class="gradient-text">网络工具与数字生活</span></h1>
      <p class="mt-7 max-w-xl text-base leading-8 text-ink-500 sm:text-lg">用结构化评测、逐步教程与横向对比，帮助中文用户更高效地查找、理解和选择数字工具。</p>
      <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="/airport/" class="focus-ring inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-ink-950 px-5 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-slate-950/15 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-brand-600">浏览机场推荐 {{ icon('arrow', 17) }}</a><a href="/guides/" class="focus-ring inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-line bg-white px-5 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-700 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-brand-100 hover:text-brand-600">{{ icon('book', 17) }}查看新手教程</a></div>
      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-7 gap-y-3 text-xs text-ink-500">{% for item in ['结构化内容','清晰更新时间','移动端友好'] %}<span class="flex items-center gap-2">{{ icon('check', 15, 'text-brand-600') }}{{ item }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="animate-float relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[31rem] lg:ml-auto">
      <div class="absolute -inset-5 rounded-[2.5rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-500/15 to-cyan-400/15 blur-2xl"></div>
      <div class="surface-card relative overflow-hidden p-5 sm:p-7">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-line pb-5"><div><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-600">CONTENT MAP</span><h2 class="mt-1 text-lg font-bold text-ink-950">你的内容导航台</h2></div><span class="grid size-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-ink-950 text-white">{{ icon('grid', 19) }}</span></div>
        <div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          {% set mapItems = [{icon:'shield',title:'评测与推荐',text:'选择前先看'},{icon:'monitor',title:'客户端教程',text:'按平台操作'},{icon:'compare',title:'产品对比',text:'差异一目了然'},{icon:'layers',title:'专题资料库',text:'系统化阅读'}] %}
          {% for item in mapItems %}<div class="rounded-2xl border p-4 {% if loop.first %}border-brand-100 bg-brand-50{% else %}border-line bg-paper/70{% endif %}">{{ icon(item.icon, 19, 'text-brand-600' if loop.first else 'text-ink-500') }}<h3 class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-950">{{ item.title }}</h3><p class="mt-1 text-[0.68rem] text-ink-500">{{ item.text }}</p></div>{% endfor %}
        </div>
        <div class="mt-5 rounded-2xl bg-ink-950 p-5 text-white"><div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs"><span class="text-slate-400">内容框架完整度</span><span class="font-semibold text-cyan-400">基础架构</span></div><div class="mt-3 h-1.5 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-white/10"><div class="h-full w-[78%] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-500 to-cyan-400"></div></div><p class="mt-4 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-400">分类、专题、品牌词与长尾内容均已预留清晰入口。</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="border-b border-line bg-white py-7"><div class="container-shell grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-center sm:grid-cols-4">{% for stat in [{value:'8+',label:'核心栏目'},{value:'6',label:'内容模型'},{value:'100%',label:'静态构建'},{value:'SEO',label:'语义优先'}] %}<div><strong class="block text-xl font-black tracking-tight text-ink-950">{{ stat.value }}</strong><span class="mt-1 block text-[0.68rem] tracking-wide text-ink-500">{{ stat.label }}</span></div>{% endfor %}</div></section>

<section class="section-space bg-white"><div class="container-shell"><div class="mb-10 max-w-2xl"><span class="eyebrow">Explore</span><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.035em] text-ink-950 sm:text-4xl">从内容类型开始探索</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[0.98rem] leading-7 text-ink-500">为不同搜索意图准备独立入口，让教程、评测、对比和资料页各自承担清晰的信息任务。</p></div><div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">{% for feature in home.features %}<a href="{{ feature.url }}" class="focus-ring group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-line bg-white p-6 transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand-100 hover:shadow-card"><span class="absolute right-5 top-4 text-4xl font-black tracking-tighter text-slate-100">0{{ loop.index }}</span><div class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-600 transition group-hover:bg-brand-600 group-hover:text-white">{{ icon(feature.icon, 21) }}</div><h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-ink-950">{{ feature.title }}</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-500">{{ feature.description }}</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-600">进入栏目 {{ icon('arrow', 14) }}</span></a>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>

<section class="section-space bg-paper"><div class="container-shell"><div class="mb-10 flex items-end justify-between gap-6"><div class="max-w-2xl"><span class="eyebrow">Featured Articles</span><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.035em] text-ink-950 sm:text-4xl">编辑推荐与最新内容</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[0.98rem] leading-7 text-ink-500">当前仅保留少量示例文章，用于展示卡片、元数据和文章详情页的完整体验。</p></div><a href="/blog/" class="hidden text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600 sm:block">查看文章索引 →</a></div><div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">{% for post in collections.posts | limit(4) %}{{ articleCard(post, loop.index0) }}{% endfor %}</div></div></section>

<section class="section-space bg-white"><div class="container-shell"><div class="mb-10 max-w-2xl"><span class="eyebrow">Topic Clusters</span><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.035em] text-ink-950 sm:text-4xl">按专题建立连续阅读路径</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-ink-500">专题页将分散文章组合成有顺序的知识路径，同时为 SEO 内容集群和站内链接预留空间。</p></div><div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">{% for topic in home.topics %}<a href="{{ topic.url }}" class="focus-ring group flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border border-line bg-white p-6 transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand-100 hover:shadow-card"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4"><span class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-2xl {{ topic.accent }}">{{ icon(topic.icon, 21) }}</span><span class="rounded-full bg-paper px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-ink-500">{{ topic.count }} 篇规划</span></div><h3 class="mt-7 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink-950">{{ topic.title }}</h3><p class="mt-3 flex-1 text-sm leading-7 text-ink-500">{{ topic.description }}</p><span class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-line pt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-700">浏览专题 {{ icon('arrow-up-right', 17) }}</span></a>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>

<section class="border-y border-line bg-[linear-gradient(135deg,#0b1020_0%,#121c38_62%,#123c43_130%)] py-20 text-white lg:py-24"><div class="container-shell grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] lg:items-center"><div class="max-w-md"><span class="eyebrow !text-cyan-400">Brand Library</span><h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.035em] sm:text-4xl">品牌词与工具资料库</h2><p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-400">为每个品牌或工具建立独立资料入口，可承载基础介绍、评测文章、使用教程、更新记录和 FAQ。</p><a href="/brands/" class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-white/15 bg-white/8 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold">查看资料库架构 {{ icon('arrow', 16) }}</a></div><div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">{% for brand in home.brands %}<a href="/brands/" class="group flex min-w-0 items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-white p-4 text-ink-900 transition hover:shadow-card"><span class="grid size-12 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-ink-950 to-brand-600 text-sm font-black text-white">{{ brand.mark }}</span><span class="min-w-0 flex-1"><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><strong class="truncate text-sm">{{ brand.name }}</strong><small class="rounded bg-paper px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.62rem] text-ink-500">{{ brand.label }}</small></span><span class="mt-1 block truncate text-xs text-ink-500">{{ brand.description }}</span></span>{{ icon('chevron', 16, 'shrink-0 text-ink-300') }}</a>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>

<section class="section-space bg-paper"><div class="container-shell"><div class="mb-10 max-w-2xl"><span class="eyebrow">Comparison</span><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.035em] text-ink-950 sm:text-4xl">用统一维度做清晰对比</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-ink-500">表格适合快速扫描，正文负责解释差异。当前数据仅为组件占位，不涉及真实服务评价。</p></div><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-line bg-white shadow-card"><div class="hidden overflow-x-auto md:block"><table class="w-full border-collapse text-left"><thead><tr class="bg-ink-950 text-white"><th class="px-6 py-5">对比维度</th><th class="px-6 py-5">示例方案 A</th><th class="px-6 py-5">示例方案 B</th><th class="px-6 py-5">示例方案 C</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for row in home.comparisons %}<tr class="border-t border-line {% if loop.index0 % 2 %}bg-paper/60{% endif %}"><th class="px-6 py-5 text-sm">{{ row.dimension }}</th><td class="px-6 py-5 text-sm text-ink-500">{{ row.a }}</td><td class="px-6 py-5 text-sm text-ink-500">{{ row.b }}</td><td class="px-6 py-5 text-sm text-ink-500">{{ row.c }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div><div class="divide-y divide-line md:hidden">{% for row in home.comparisons %}<div class="p-5"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold">{{ row.dimension }}</h3><dl class="mt-3 grid gap-2 text-xs"><div class="flex justify-between"><dt>方案 A</dt><dd>{{ row.a }}</dd></div><div class="flex justify-between"><dt>方案 B</dt><dd>{{ row.b }}</dd></div><div class="flex justify-between"><dt>方案 C</dt><dd>{{ row.c }}</dd></div></dl></div>{% endfor %}</div></div></div></section>

<section class="section-space bg-white"><div class="container-shell grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.75fr_1.25fr] lg:gap-20"><div><span class="eyebrow">Content Foundation</span><h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.035em] text-ink-950 sm:text-4xl">为长期内容运营预留的正文模块</h2><p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-7 text-ink-500">以下为首页 SEO 正文的语义结构示例，正式上线前可替换为经过审核的原创内容。</p></div><div class="grid gap-8 border-l border-line pl-7 sm:pl-10">{% for item in [{n:'01',title:'如何选择适合自己的网络工具？',text:'预留需求判断、设备环境、使用频率与预算等基础内容。'},{n:'02',title:'阅读评测时应该关注什么？',text:'预留测试时间、环境、数据来源和结论边界说明。'},{n:'03',title:'从安装到排错，教程如何组织？',text:'预留按平台拆分的教程入口和完整的排错路径。'}] %}<article><span class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-600">{{ item.n }} / 内容模块</span><h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-ink-950">{{ item.title }}</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-ink-500">{{ item.text }}</p></article>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>

<section class="section-space border-t border-line bg-paper"><div class="container-shell"><div class="mx-auto mb-10 max-w-3xl text-center"><span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold text-ink-950 sm:text-4xl">常见问题</h2><p class="mt-4 text-ink-500">先回答读者最关心的问题，再提供可以继续深入阅读的站内入口。</p></div>{{ faq(home.faqs) }}</div></section>

<section class="container-shell pb-20 lg:pb-28"><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-ink-950 px-6 py-14 text-white sm:px-10 lg:px-16"><div class="absolute -right-24 -top-32 size-96 rounded-full bg-brand-500/30 blur-3xl"></div><div class="relative grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] lg:items-center"><div><span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[.15em] text-cyan-400">START EXPLORING</span><h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">从一个问题开始，找到更清晰的答案</h2><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">浏览文章索引，或按专题查看成体系的教程、评测与对比内容。</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="/blog/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-950">{{ icon('book', 17) }}浏览文章</a><a href="/topics/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-white/20 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold">{{ icon('grid', 17) }}查看专题</a></div></div></div></section>
